Epm_TN&_nc_oc=AdnCN1J0eLR7tZ58K740pl7Or0fQz1kuw_eEeW5WT7v5Umo6d4paBQYPH4T3ak2LsAs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwXWNrtl0xzHC6-bBpSjvhaBzJVS4qK2dljZEh-p9oZUQ&oe=69B95E03"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The use of descending life line_Landscape.png", "id": "924296409342275", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86629761_924296412675608_6973496143769541780_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AhXcgyqNH3kQ7kNvwHBlMPh&_nc_oc=AdnXQfqH-ncMh82Rn8Oee7VC_N1tvNugHbA8COvF7O6a5NorRtmvCOjxqeFVj7y4Ztc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwBK-bjUzjXHj8yPvaklmuI7R_K0su5QvwYjrS_yIjshA&oe=69B94878"}, "display_name": "The Use Of Descending Life Line- ContentsDa", "keywords": ["safety", "fire", "descent", "simulation", "contentsda"], "long_description": "1. Fire situation: There is a fire and you need to escape.\n2. Use the sturdy: Utilize the sturdy to escape.\n3. Install the Stubborn: Install the green hook from the Stubborn box onto the Stubborn support.\n4. Set the speeder: Set the red speeder by overlapping it on the hook.\n5. Move the Stubborn Support: Grab the Stubborn Support and move it off the railing.\n6. Throw the rope: Throw the rope wound on the black reel out the window.\n7. Manipulate the stubbornness belt: Lower the yellow stubbornness belt under your armpits and tighten it.\n8. safe descent: Hold onto the wall with your hands and descend safely without lifting your arms.\n9. successful escape: You have safely escaped and overcome the fire situation.", "short_description": "Understand the critical use of life lines in rescue operations. This experiment teaches the proper techniques for descending from heights safely."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "Co